{"unit_id":"WolfGenerals__ncm-player#card-zh","repo":"WolfGenerals/ncm-player","commit":"f40f982715128d2f4d7928012b6cebf86af4d40e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"ncm-player 是 DSH Web 的网易云音乐浮窗播放器，通过 shell.overlay 插槽展示可拖动、可折叠的播放器，并由主机端 API 连接 music.163.com。它支持搜索歌曲、歌单和专辑，播放队列控制，逐行歌词及翻译，也可登录后浏览个人歌单和收藏音乐。适合希望在 DSH Web 会话中听歌、查找音乐并同步查看歌词的用户。播放和搜索无需登录；个人音乐与收藏需要网易云音乐账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:963","index.mjs:490","index.mjs:435"]}
{"unit_id":"WolfGenerals__ncm-player#card-en","repo":"WolfGenerals/ncm-player","commit":"f40f982715128d2f4d7928012b6cebf86af4d40e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"ncm-player adds a NetEase Cloud Music player to DSH Web. Its floating window searches songs, playlists, and albums, plays tracks, manages a queue, and displays timed lyrics. Sign in to browse personal playlists and save favorites; search and playback need no sign-in.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:963","index.mjs:490","index.mjs:435"]}
