{"unit_id":"WolfGenerals__ncm-player#feature-1","repo":"WolfGenerals/ncm-player","commit":"f40f982715128d2f4d7928012b6cebf86af4d40e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ncm-player 的功能「音乐搜索与发现」：可按关键词搜索歌曲、歌单或专辑，也能浏览热门歌单。用户在浮窗的发现页选择类别并搜索，结果可打开详情或加入播放队列。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:252","index.mjs:278","index.mjs:284","index.mjs:292"]}
{"unit_id":"WolfGenerals__ncm-player#feature-2","repo":"WolfGenerals/ncm-player","commit":"f40f982715128d2f4d7928012b6cebf86af4d40e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ncm-player 的功能「播放与队列」：播放器支持播放控制、切换曲目、调整进度和音量，并管理待播列表。用户从歌曲、歌单或专辑选择曲目开始播放，也可在队列中选择、移除或清空曲目。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:468","lib/client.js:487","lib/client.js:848"]}
{"unit_id":"WolfGenerals__ncm-player#feature-3","repo":"WolfGenerals/ncm-player","commit":"f40f982715128d2f4d7928012b6cebf86af4d40e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ncm-player 的功能「同步歌词」：播放歌曲时获取逐行歌词及翻译文本，并按时间高亮当前行。用户可点击歌词跳转到对应播放进度，迷你模式也能显示当前歌词。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:363","lib/client.js:158","lib/client.js:754"]}
{"unit_id":"WolfGenerals__ncm-player#feature-4","repo":"WolfGenerals/ncm-player","commit":"f40f982715128d2f4d7928012b6cebf86af4d40e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ncm-player 的功能「账号音乐库」：登录网易云音乐账号后，可查看个人歌单和收藏专辑，并对歌曲执行喜欢或取消喜欢。用户可粘贴 Cookie 或用网易云音乐 App 扫码登录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:317","index.mjs:327","index.mjs:380","lib/client.js:553","lib/client.js:591"]}
{"unit_id":"WolfGenerals__ncm-player#feature-5","repo":"WolfGenerals/ncm-player","commit":"f40f982715128d2f4d7928012b6cebf86af4d40e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ncm-player 的功能「浮窗与迷你模式」：播放器显示在 DSH Web 的浮窗中，可拖动位置、折叠为迷你条或隐藏后从角落按钮重新打开。用户可在设置中控制迷你歌词显示、滚动和字号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:963","lib/client.js:671","lib/client.js:953"]}
{"unit_id":"WolfGenerals__ncm-player#caveat-1","repo":"WolfGenerals/ncm-player","commit":"f40f982715128d2f4d7928012b6cebf86af4d40e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"ncm-player 使用 music.163.com 搜索、获取播放地址和歌词，登录后的个人音乐与收藏操作也连接该服务；播放和搜索可不登录，个人内容需账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:252","index.mjs:363","index.mjs:454"]}
{"unit_id":"WolfGenerals__ncm-player#caveat-2","repo":"WolfGenerals/ncm-player","commit":"f40f982715128d2f4d7928012b6cebf86af4d40e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"账号 Cookie 和播放队列保存在浏览器 localStorage；更换浏览器或清除站点数据后需重新登录，队列等本地状态也不会保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:133","lib/client.js:140","lib/client.js:148"]}
